#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Name            : acctclsmn001.scr
#  Description     : This script is setup in HBJSTM and executed as a batch job.
#				   : All the closed accounts of scheme code will be marked as deleted in custom table
#  Date            : 28-01-2013
#  Author          : Samrat Saha
#  Input           : NA
#  Output          : NA
#  Called Script   : NA
